# Tests & benchmarks

- One QA tree: `Agents/benchmark/` — unit/integration tests in `Agents/benchmark/tests/`, benchmark harness and tasks alongside (`Agents/benchmark/README.md`).
- Run: `uv run --extra dev --extra observability --extra opencl --extra faiss --extra mem0 pytest Agents/benchmark -q` (or a focused path).
- SQL Pro: `Agents/benchmark/sql_pro/`, `uv run python -m benchmark.sql_pro.run`, `.cursor/commands/sql-pro.md`.
- Do not commit `Agents/benchmark/results/` (gitignored).
- Failing test first for bugs; no skip/xfail to green the gate.
